# Network binaries stay out: the weights are NVIDIA-derived and the runtime comes from a
# third-party project with its own distribution terms. Whoever clones brings their own.
# (See README, "Getting the runtime and the weights".)
#
# Third-party HEADERS are the opposite: they are vendored in external/reshade/ so a fresh
# clone builds with nothing else to download. See external/reshade/NOTICE.md.
*.dll
*.bin
*.addon64
*.exe
*.obj
*.lib
*.exp
*.pdb

# Build and run output
build/
builds/
*.log
*.ppm
*.raw

# One-off scripts, no value to anyone cloning
patch_*.py
check_ppm.py
